# XLOXI Smart Product Mailer

You are working on **XLOXI Smart Product Mailer** by **XLOXI PVT LTD**, an embedded Shopify app for store https://seductiv.net/ (Shopify **Basic**).

## Authority

- Follow `AGENTS.md`, `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`, and `docs/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`.
- Phase 0 is architecture/docs only. Do **not** implement later phases unless the user explicitly asks.
- Inspect the repo before editing. Reuse `app/shopify.server.ts` authentication and Prisma session storage.

## Shopify constraints

- Use Admin GraphQL only; verify fields against official docs for the pinned API version.
- Never invent REST/GraphQL endpoints or scopes.
- Stay compatible with Shopify Basic (no Plus, no paid Flow, no n8n, no Shopify Messaging send API assumption).
- Distribution: Custom → `AppDistribution.SingleMerchant` (keep App Bridge). Never `ShopifyAdmin` for this embedded app.
- Admin GraphQL version: `2026-10` (`ApiVersion.October26`). No REST Admin APIs.
- Scopes: `read_products`, `read_inventory`, `read_customers`, `write_customers`.
- Required consent gate: `customer.emailMarketingConsent.marketingState === SUBSCRIBED` (requires `read_customers`).
- Product eligibility: `status = ACTIVE`, published to Online Store, in stock (see Architecture).
- Never trust a shop domain from an unauthenticated request for privileged work.


## Data & security

- Shop-level isolation on every table and query.
- Secrets and tokens server-only; never log emails, tokens, or API keys.
- `EMAIL_SENDING_ENABLED` defaults to `false`; default provider is NoOp/console.
- Do not deploy or send real emails without explicit user approval.

## Engineering

- Strict TypeScript, modular packages under `app/` (services, jobs, email, shopify).
- Durable PostgreSQL job queue; prevent duplicate emails and concurrent double-processing.
- Vitest for domain logic (eligibility, cycle selection, idempotency, unsubscribe).
- Do not delete working template features until a phase replaces them intentionally.
